      <title>Trump’s Oil Deal Riles Both Sides of Venezuelan Political Divide</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-29/trump-s-oil-deal-riles-both-sides-of-venezuelan-political-divide</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">a6965365cf4f3f57618a5ae9</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 21:50:49 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Venezuelan hard-liners and opposition forces alike criticized acting President Delcy Rodríguez for agreeing to grant the US exclusive access to the country’s valuable oil resources. She may be betting that the deal with Donald Trump is her ticket to a tighter grip on power.</description>
